url: "https://github.com/kazuru-chidumbwe/livepatch-differential-harness/tree/softwarex-lp1-20260725b"
abstract: >-
  Differential test harness for Linux livepatch build pipelines. Identical
  source patches are built with multiple tools under a pinned kernel commit;
  outputs are compared for trace-equivalence using hand-built klp_patch
  reference modules, ELF normalization, and per-case predicate suites.
keywords:
  - livepatch
  - Linux
  - differential testing
  - kpatch
  - package
